# Google Drive OAuth Configuration
# Register an OAuth 2.0 Web Client in Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Add Authorized JavaScript origin: https://valpr.github.io (and http://localhost:5173 for local dev)
# 2. Add Authorized Redirect URI: https://valpr.github.io/custom-ereader/auth (and http://localhost:5173/auth)
VITE_GDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=

# Microsoft OneDrive OAuth Configuration
# Register an app in Azure Portal (App Registrations):
# 1. Supported account types: Personal Microsoft accounts only (or Accounts in any organizational directory and personal Microsoft accounts)
# 2. Add Single-Page Application (SPA) redirect URI: https://valpr.github.io/custom-ereader/auth (and http://localhost:5173/auth)
VITE_ONEDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=

# Deployment & Routing (Optional)
# VITE_PAGE_PATH=/custom-ereader
# BASE_PATH=/custom-ereader
